divergence.broiler-js: rows M6 and M1a: Broiler.JS rounds a Number by its binary value, so 1.35, whose shortest digits ToIntlMathematicalValue reads as a tie, rounds up under halfFloor and halfTrunc (row M1a, a correction of Broiler.JS); answered by SJL-9.5, this engine's cut-over to the shared Intl library
