note: row P3 (data, C5): the language's cardinal categories; decision D5: Broiler.VM's locale list stays de, de-DE, en and en-US, so it resolves fr to en-US (LookupMatcher over its list, rows L28 and T16) and its expectation is the reference's answer for that locale; Broiler.JS's embedding carries the locale, so its expectation is out
